<section id="S3" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">3 </span>Experiment</h2>

<section id="S3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.1 </span>Baselines and Experiment Setup</h3>

<section id="S3.SS1.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">3.1.1 </span>Baselines</h4>

<div id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We compare our method against the following baselines:</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Full</span>: Refers to the Alpaca dataset <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">14</a>]</cite> containing 52k instruction-following samples.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Random Sampling</span>: Randomly select 2.6k samples from the Alpaca dataset.</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.SSS1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">AlpaGasus</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">6</a>]</cite>: A high-quality subset of Alpaca containing about 9.2k examples, from which we selected 2.6k samples for SFT.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S3.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:165.6pt;height:50.5pt;vertical-align:-24.3pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-137.9pt,42.0pt) scale(0.375255024312629,0.375255024312629) ;">
<table id="S3.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S3.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S3.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:1.5pt;padding-bottom:1.5pt;" rowspan="2"><span id="S3.T2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">Method</span></th>
